---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import ToolCards from '../../components/ToolCards.astro';
import { herramientasIA } from '../../datos/herramientas';
import PageIndex from '../../components/PageIndex.astro';
import ContactCards from '../../components/ContactCards.astro';
import PixelArrow from '../../components/PixelArrow.astro';
---
<Base
  lang="es"
  pagina="entorno/"
  titulo={"Entorno · Roger Avellana"}
  descripcion={"Servicios de Roger Avellana — diseño visual, branding, UI/UX, marketing digital e IA aplicada al diseño."}
  activa="entorno"
  silkscreen
>
  <PageIndex lang="es" secciones={[['top', 'Inicio'], ['lista-servicios', 'Servicios'], ['herramientas', 'Herramientas'], ['auto-demo', 'Automatización'], ['contacto', 'Contacto']]} />

  <main id="main">

    <header class="about-hero" id="top">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Entorno</span>
        <h1>Lo que <em>hago.</em></h1>
        <p class="about-hero-bio">
          Cinco direcciones donde combino diseño visual con pensamiento estratégico. No son
          silos: se solapan, se nutren entre sí, y al final hablan del mismo proyecto desde
          ángulos distintos.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section id="lista-servicios">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="card-grid services-bento">
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon-badge i-lav">
              <svg class="px-icon" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="currentColor" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="1" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="10" y="1" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="8" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="9" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="10" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="7" y="3" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="8" y="3" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="9" y="3" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="7" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="8" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="5" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="5" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="7" y="5" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="4" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="3" y="7" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="4" y="7" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="7" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="2" y="8" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="3" y="8" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="1" y="9" width="1" height="1"/><rect class="px-draw" style="--d:0" x="3" y="10" width="1" height="1"/><rect class="px-draw" style="--d:1" x="5" y="10" width="1" height="1"/><rect class="px-draw" style="--d:2" x="7" y="10" width="1" height="1"/><rect class="px-draw" style="--d:3" x="9" y="10" width="1" height="1"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="card-num">01</span>
            <h3>Diseño visual &amp; dirección creativa</h3>
            <p>Desde el concepto hasta la pieza final. Doy forma al lenguaje visual de tu marca —
              tipografía, color, composición y sistema gráfico — para que cada punto de contacto
              hable el mismo idioma.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon-badge i-peach">
              <svg class="px-icon" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="currentColor" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true"><g class="px-hop"><rect x="3" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="4" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="7" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="8" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="2" y="3" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="9" y="3" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="3" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="4" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="7" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="8" y="4" width="1" height="1"/></g><g opacity=".7"><rect x="2" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="9" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="3" y="7" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="4" y="7" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="7" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="7" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="7" y="7" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="8" y="7" width="1" height="1"/></g><g opacity=".45"><rect x="2" y="9" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="9" y="9" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="3" y="10" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="4" y="10" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="10" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="10" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="7" y="10" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="8" y="10" width="1" height="1"/></g></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="card-num">02</span>
            <h3>Branding &amp; identidad corporativa</h3>
            <p>Construyo identidades que escalan: del símbolo a la guía de marca completa. Piezas
              que funcionan en papel, en pantalla, en un stand de feria y en un story de
              Instagram.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon-badge i-mint">
              <svg class="px-icon" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="currentColor" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="0" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="2" y="0" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="3" y="0" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="4" y="0" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="0" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="0" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="7" y="0" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="8" y="0" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="9" y="0" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="10" y="0" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="1" y="1" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="10" y="1" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="1" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="3" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="4" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="10" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="1" y="3" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="10" y="3" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="1" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="3" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="4" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="10" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="1" y="5" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="10" y="5" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="1" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="2" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="3" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="4" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="7" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="8" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="9" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="10" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="7" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="7" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="3" y="8" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="4" y="8" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="8" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="8" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="7" y="8" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="8" y="8" width="1" height="1"/><rect class="px-caret" x="8" y="4" width="1" height="1"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="card-num">03</span>
            <h3>UI/UX &amp; diseño de interfaces</h3>
            <p>Wireframes, prototipos y diseño final en Figma, con foco en jerarquía,
              accesibilidad y flujos claros. Plataformas IoT, dashboards industriales y portales
              B2B donde la usabilidad no es opcional.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="feature-card feature-card--wide">
            <div class="icon-badge i-lav">
              <svg class="px-icon" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="currentColor" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true"><g class="px-fly"><rect x="10" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="8" y="3" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="9" y="3" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="10" y="3" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="7" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="8" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="9" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="10" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="4" y="5" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="5" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="5" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="8" y="5" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="9" y="5" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="2" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="3" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="4" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="8" y="6" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="7" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="7" y="7" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="8" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="7" y="8" width="1" height="1"/></g><rect class="px-trail" style="--d:0" x="1" y="9" width="1" height="1"/><rect class="px-trail" style="--d:1" x="3" y="10" width="1" height="1"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="fc-body">
              <span class="card-num">04</span>
              <h3>Marketing digital &amp; contenido</h3>
              <p>Estrategia y ejecución para redes sociales y campañas publicitarias. Calendarios
                editoriales, packs de posts y análisis de métricas, pensando en el feed y no solo en
                la pieza individual.</p>
              <ul class="fc-chips">
                <li>Calendario editorial</li>
                <li>Packs de posts</li>
                <li>Campañas</li>
                <li>Métricas</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="feature-card feature-card--wide feature-card--ai">
            <div class="icon-badge i-peach">
              <svg class="px-icon" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="currentColor" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true"><g class="px-beat-icon"><rect x="5" y="0" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="1" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="4" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="2" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="2" y="3" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="3" y="3" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="4" y="3" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="3" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="3" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="7" y="3" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="8" y="3" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="4" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="6" y="4" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="5" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="5" y="6" width="1" height="1"/></g><g class="px-spark"><rect x="10" y="7" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="9" y="8" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="10" y="8" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="11" y="8" width="1" height="1"/><rect x="10" y="9" width="1" height="1"/></g></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="fc-body">
              <span class="card-num">05</span>
              <h3>IA aplicada al diseño</h3>
              <p>Uso Claude, ChatGPT y Gemini como herramientas para acelerar el proceso, no para
                sustituir el criterio. Iteraciones que antes tomaban semanas hoy se resuelven en
                días.</p>
              <ul class="fc-chips">
                <li>Claude</li>
                <li>ChatGPT</li>
                <li>Gemini</li>
                <li>Criterio humano</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HERRAMIENTAS -->
    <section class="tools-section" id="herramientas">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <span class="section-label">/ herramientas</span>
          <h2>Mi caja de <em>herramientas.</em></h2>
          <p>Las herramientas con las que trabajo cada día. La IA generativa y el vibe coding ya forman parte de mi proceso: me ayudan a pasar antes de la idea al prototipo, sin renunciar al criterio.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tools-feature">
          <article class="tools-gen">
            <span class="tools-kicker">01 · IA generativa</span>
            <h3>IA generativa</h3>
            <p>Texto, imagen, vídeo y voz para idear, explorar y producir más rápido.</p>
            <ToolCards lang="es" pagina="entorno/" herramientas={herramientasIA} />
          </article>

          <article class="tools-vibe">
            <div class="tv-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="it-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>~/vibe-coding</span></div>
            <div class="tv-body">
              <span class="tools-kicker">02 · Vibe coding</span>
              <h3>Vibe coding</h3>
              <p>Construyo webs, prototipos y herramientas describiendo lo que necesito.</p>
              <ul class="tv-list">
              <li><span class="tv-prompt" aria-hidden="true">$</span><strong>claude-code</strong><small>Anthropic · agente en la terminal</small></li>
              <li><span class="tv-prompt" aria-hidden="true">$</span><strong>cursor</strong><small>editor de código con IA</small></li>
              <li><span class="tv-prompt" aria-hidden="true">$</span><strong>codex</strong><small>OpenAI · agente de código</small></li>
              <li><span class="tv-prompt" aria-hidden="true">$</span><strong>gemini-cli</strong><small>Google · agente en la terminal</small></li>
              <li><span class="tv-prompt" aria-hidden="true">$</span><strong>antigravity</strong><small>Google · IDE con agentes</small></li>
              <li><span class="tv-prompt" aria-hidden="true">$</span><strong>kiro</strong><small>AWS · IDE con agentes</small></li>
              </ul>
              <a class="tv-link" href="https://github.com/rocher-dev9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Ver mi código en GitHub"><span class="tv-prompt" aria-hidden="true">$</span> open <strong>github.com/rocher-dev9</strong> <PixelArrow /></a>
              <p class="tv-note"><span class="tv-prompt" aria-hidden="true">›</span> Yo dirijo, la IA programa: defino, reviso y valido cada cambio.<span class="it-cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="tools-base">
          <span class="tools-kicker">03 · Mi stack diario</span>
        </div>

        <div class="logo-band" role="group" aria-label="Herramientas que uso a diario">
          <ul class="lb-track"><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/claude.svg); --brand:#D97757" aria-hidden="true"></span>Claude</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">CH</span>ChatGPT</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/googlegemini.svg); --brand:#8E75B2" aria-hidden="true"></span>Gemini</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">MJ</span>Midjourney</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">FF</span>Firefly</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">HF</span>Higgsfield</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/cursor.svg); --brand:#15121f" aria-hidden="true"></span>Cursor</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">KI</span>Kiro</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/n8n.svg); --brand:#EA4B71" aria-hidden="true"></span>n8n</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/notion.svg); --brand:#15121f" aria-hidden="true"></span>Notion</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/claude.svg); --brand:#D97757" aria-hidden="true"></span>Claude</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">CH</span>ChatGPT</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/googlegemini.svg); --brand:#8E75B2" aria-hidden="true"></span>Gemini</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">MJ</span>Midjourney</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">FF</span>Firefly</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">HF</span>Higgsfield</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/cursor.svg); --brand:#15121f" aria-hidden="true"></span>Cursor</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">KI</span>Kiro</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/n8n.svg); --brand:#EA4B71" aria-hidden="true"></span>n8n</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/notion.svg); --brand:#15121f" aria-hidden="true"></span>Notion</li></ul>
          <ul class="lb-track lb-track--rev"><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/figma.svg); --brand:#F24E1E" aria-hidden="true"></span>Figma</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">PS</span>Photoshop</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">AI</span>Illustrator</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">ID</span>InDesign</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">CV</span>Canva</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/google.svg); --brand:#4285F4" aria-hidden="true"></span>Google</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/html5.svg); --brand:#E34F26" aria-hidden="true"></span>HTML5</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/css.svg); --brand:#663399" aria-hidden="true"></span>CSS</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/javascript.svg); --brand:#c9a800" aria-hidden="true"></span>JavaScript</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">GA</span>Gamma</li><li class="lb-chip"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">GW</span>Google Workspace</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/figma.svg); --brand:#F24E1E" aria-hidden="true"></span>Figma</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">PS</span>Photoshop</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">AI</span>Illustrator</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">ID</span>InDesign</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">CV</span>Canva</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/google.svg); --brand:#4285F4" aria-hidden="true"></span>Google</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/html5.svg); --brand:#E34F26" aria-hidden="true"></span>HTML5</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/css.svg); --brand:#663399" aria-hidden="true"></span>CSS</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/javascript.svg); --brand:#c9a800" aria-hidden="true"></span>JavaScript</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">GA</span>Gamma</li><li class="lb-chip" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lb-mono" aria-hidden="true">GW</span>Google Workspace</li></ul>
        </div>

        <div class="auto-demo" id="auto-demo">
          <div class="ad-head">
            <span class="tools-kicker">04 · Automatización</span>
            <h3>Herramientas que trabajan juntas.</h3>
            <p>Conecto aplicaciones con n8n y la IA para que las tareas repetitivas se hagan solas. Así funciona un flujo:</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ad-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Ejemplos de automatización"><button type="button" role="tab" class="ad-tab" data-flow="0" aria-selected="true">Briefs</button><button type="button" role="tab" class="ad-tab" data-flow="1" aria-selected="false">Informes</button><button type="button" role="tab" class="ad-tab" data-flow="2" aria-selected="false">Contenido</button></div>
          <div class="ad-flow" role="tabpanel">
            <div class="ad-node" data-step="1"><span class="ad-ico" style="--logo:url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.35.0/icons/googleforms.svg)" aria-hidden="true"></span><strong>Google Forms</strong><small>1 · llega un brief</small></div>
            <span class="ad-link" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
